   "POI: the C2 extreme so far tags, first vs C1, one of PDL/PWL, last Asia/London/NY-AM session low, a C2-TF 2/2 swing low confirmed before C2 (<= 48 C2 bars), or the top of a bullish C2-TF FVG (<= 48 C2 bars); bearish mirrored",
   "unicorn on the paired TF: breaker = highest-high bar in the 12 bars before the C2 low; confirm on a close above it with a bullish FVG after the low overlapping the breaker's [body low, high]; breaker->confirm <= 12 bars",
   "entry next M1 open after the confirming close; stop at the C2 extreme so far; 2R; hold 4 C2 bars; first per C2 per direction"
  ],
